WEBVTT

00:16.590 --> 00:18.640
One more goal.

00:29.250 --> 00:31.030
If we get this number, we win.

00:31.500 --> 00:33.150
If we stop them, we win!

00:34.160 --> 00:37.530
This is our last chance.

00:38.780 --> 00:40.740
<i>I can see it and feel it.</i>

00:40.750 --> 00:42.120
<i>Those in motion,</i>

00:42.740 --> 00:43.990
<i>me and those three!</i>

00:44.740 --> 00:46.870
<i>I can smell a goal from these three.</i>

00:47.580 --> 00:51.120
<i>With these eyes and my foresight,
I'll pave the way to the goal.</i>

00:51.210 --> 00:53.490
<i>This counterattack will be our final move!</i>

00:53.920 --> 00:56.000
<i>If they get the ball, it's the end for us.</i>

00:56.090 --> 00:58.410
<i>Even if it kills me, I won't give up this ball!</i>

01:00.170 --> 01:01.360
<i>Push forward, Bachira!</i>

01:01.920 --> 01:05.050
<i>Tear through the opposing team
with your limitless dribbling!</i>

01:07.230 --> 01:09.734
<i>The opponent will even foul us
just to stop us.</i>

01:09.759 --> 01:10.770
Bachira, over here!

01:12.800 --> 01:16.140
<i>We can't let the ball stop.
We have to create another route.</i>

01:16.150 --> 01:17.520
<i>I can see it.</i>

01:17.610 --> 01:21.030
<i>Tear through the opponent with those legs, Chigiri!</i>

01:25.530 --> 01:26.820
We need to increase our numbers!

01:28.160 --> 01:29.690
<i>Acting cautiously, huh?</i>

01:29.700 --> 01:30.700
Chigiri!

01:32.120 --> 01:35.000
<i>You always finish in good places.</i>

01:35.080 --> 01:37.380
<i>Let's tear through them together!</i>

01:38.710 --> 01:40.163
Don't let them pass to each other!

01:42.510 --> 01:43.990
<i>Is he going through the midfield?</i>

01:44.470 --> 01:47.180
<i>Is he using me as bait
and advancing alone?</i>

01:47.260 --> 01:51.140
<i>Just as I foresaw, I can do this.
I'll dominate the pitch.</i>

01:52.100 --> 01:53.890
<i>No matter what, I'll get that number!</i>

01:55.640 --> 01:58.760
<i>Back then, my body moved on its own.</i>

01:59.690 --> 02:02.740
<i>I didn't have a goal like helping you.</i>

02:03.530 --> 02:06.690
<i>It was because I saw that there
was something more important</i>

02:08.530 --> 02:11.330
<i>than winning without doing anything.</i>

02:11.990 --> 02:13.540
Isn't that enough?

02:13.620 --> 02:15.330
Kuon, you're too serious.

02:16.080 --> 02:18.630
<i>Do you see it, my past self?</i>

02:19.920 --> 02:22.700
<i>The soccer you believed in back then,</i>

02:23.130 --> 02:25.670
<i>it's right here, right now.</i>

02:28.470 --> 02:31.690
Press!

02:32.430 --> 02:34.230
<i>Two defenders left.</i>

02:34.310 --> 02:37.770
<i>We'll tear through together with Kunigami!</i>

02:38.270 --> 02:40.020
<i>If we can get past here,</i>

02:40.610 --> 02:42.250
<i>only the goalkeeper is left!</i>

02:43.320 --> 02:44.360
<i>Zantetsu?</i>

02:44.440 --> 02:46.780
<i>Much faster than I predicted!</i>

02:49.000 --> 02:51.100
I won't let you shoot from mid-range!

02:51.200 --> 02:53.330
Nice! The ball bounced off Kunigami!

02:53.410 --> 02:55.120
If it goes out, we're done!

02:55.200 --> 02:56.430
Shit!

02:59.880 --> 03:03.120
-Raichi?
-Why doesn't this guy get tired?

03:03.130 --> 03:05.380
Didn't I tell you to score!

03:05.460 --> 03:07.130
I'll kill you all!

03:07.970 --> 03:09.490
Push forward, you imbeciles!

03:12.810 --> 03:13.810
<i>Bachira!</i>

03:14.890 --> 03:16.840
- Come on!
- Pass to me!

03:16.850 --> 03:18.310
Watch the center!

03:18.390 --> 03:20.020
Don't let him shoot!

03:20.650 --> 03:21.690
<i>I can see it.</i>

03:21.770 --> 03:23.940
<i>Chigiri and Kunigami's positions…</i>

03:23.950 --> 03:26.220
<i>The defensive players
will block them.</i>

03:26.240 --> 03:27.780
<i>On the other side,</i>

03:27.860 --> 03:29.820
<i>19 meters away on the left of the goal.</i>

03:30.450 --> 03:33.410
<i>That's the zone that will
make my goal possible!</i>

03:33.490 --> 03:35.080
<i>Come, Bachira!</i>

03:35.160 --> 03:36.540
<i>I know you'll understand!</i>

03:36.620 --> 03:38.370
Mark number 9!

03:38.460 --> 03:40.880
<i>Feel me!</i>

03:42.420 --> 03:44.280
<i>I believe in you, Isagi.</i>

03:44.880 --> 03:49.250
<i>I know you can turn this shot into a goal.</i>

03:49.630 --> 03:51.700
<i>You're the man, Bachira.</i>

03:51.980 --> 03:54.550
<i>All that's left is to control the ball
and bury it in the net.</i>

03:54.560 --> 03:55.650
<i>I can do it!</i>

03:56.470 --> 03:57.470
<i>I…</i>

03:58.140 --> 03:59.190
<i>We…</i>

04:06.320 --> 04:08.990
We really do run into each other
a lot, don't we?

04:09.860 --> 04:11.700
<i>Did the smell of the goal suddenly disappear?</i>

04:12.700 --> 04:15.870
<i>What is this monster doing here?</i>

04:16.620 --> 04:22.000
Right now, you are the most
dangerous person on this pitch.

04:22.080 --> 04:23.210
<i>What will I do?</i>

04:23.920 --> 04:25.250
<i>I have to make a decision!</i>

04:26.300 --> 04:29.960
<i>I'll arrive where the ball drops before him.</i>

04:30.550 --> 04:32.680
<i>I'm the one who will touch the ball first.</i>

04:32.760 --> 04:35.860
<i>So this duel depends on how I control the ball!</i>

04:37.640 --> 04:38.770
<i>Did he dive in?</i>

04:39.640 --> 04:43.270
<i>If I slow down, he'll pass me
and prevent me from shooting.</i>

04:43.940 --> 04:45.650
<i>Ordinary traps won't work.</i>

04:46.400 --> 04:48.860
<i>I need superior ball control
that will let me shoot</i>

04:48.940 --> 04:50.740
<i>while the ball is spinning at full speed!</i>

04:51.490 --> 04:53.420
<i>Can I pull off something like this?</i>

04:53.860 --> 04:55.910
<i>If I screw it up, we're done for.</i>

04:57.910 --> 04:59.080
<i>It's no use.</i>

04:59.620 --> 05:01.330
<i>The image leading to the goal doesn't form.</i>

05:01.870 --> 05:04.170
<i>Even if I know the future of the pitch,</i>

05:05.630 --> 05:07.720
<i>I can't see a future where I win!</i>

05:10.010 --> 05:12.150
You can't defeat me.

05:12.190 --> 05:13.190
Shut up!

05:13.260 --> 05:14.640
Over here, Isagi!

05:14.720 --> 05:15.930
Send the ball to me!

05:16.760 --> 05:18.140
<i>No!</i>

05:18.220 --> 05:19.390
<i>I</i>

05:21.100 --> 05:23.850
<i>want to win with my own goal!</i>

05:26.770 --> 05:27.860
<i>My own goal?</i>

05:28.480 --> 05:30.400
Yes, Isagi.

05:30.480 --> 05:31.610
Remember.

05:32.320 --> 05:33.820
Your own goal!

05:35.910 --> 05:38.620
<i>I see. So that's how it was.</i>

05:38.700 --> 05:40.330
You fall short.

05:40.490 --> 05:44.860
<i>What was blocking my vision were the
options I was thinking about to control the ball.</i>

05:45.330 --> 05:50.000
<i>Waiting for the ball to drop turned
my future self into an ineffective player on the pitch.</i>

05:50.710 --> 05:52.550
<i>There's no point in being like this!</i>

05:52.730 --> 05:54.520
<i>It was always like that until now.</i>

05:54.720 --> 05:58.620
<i>I have no speed, no power, and no technique.</i>

05:58.640 --> 06:00.630
<i>The reason I'm in Blue Lock</i>

06:00.640 --> 06:01.590
WEAPON, SPATIAL AWARENESS, ABILITIES

06:01.600 --> 06:04.690
<i>and the final piece needed for my goal...</i>

06:05.890 --> 06:10.070
<i>a direct shot that won't give
anyone time to reach the future</i>

06:14.490 --> 06:17.200
<i>where I exist!</i>

06:34.880 --> 06:38.260
<i>This is the formula for my goal.</i>

06:44.310 --> 06:48.060
<i>This is the moment of Isagi Yoichi's awakening!</i>

06:48.600 --> 06:51.610
BL RANK 267
ISAGI YOICHI

08:28.910 --> 08:31.290
-That's it!
-That's it!

08:31.370 --> 08:32.420
You did great!

08:32.500 --> 08:34.380
You can't be serious.

08:34.460 --> 08:35.460
Fuck!

08:35.960 --> 08:38.050
<i>Did I... lose?</i>

08:38.840 --> 08:39.920
<i>We…</i>

08:40.010 --> 08:40.840
Reo!

08:40.920 --> 08:42.920
We still have time.

08:43.300 --> 08:45.140
Nagi, you…

08:45.220 --> 08:47.900
If we score two more, we can still…

08:50.930 --> 08:52.600
<i>The match is over.</i>

08:52.690 --> 08:55.310
<i>Team Z won with a 5-4 score.</i>

08:57.520 --> 08:58.520
Hey, Reo.

08:59.530 --> 09:05.450
So this is what it feels like to lose
after fighting properly?

09:06.780 --> 09:07.780
It's really frustrating.

09:08.740 --> 09:10.080
Hell yeah!

09:10.160 --> 09:11.370
They,

09:12.160 --> 09:13.750
they really won.

09:13.830 --> 09:14.920
Hey, Kuon.

09:15.500 --> 09:17.920
What are you doing? Come join us.

09:18.000 --> 09:19.760
Huh? I'm fine like this.

09:19.840 --> 09:22.380
What does it matter? We won in the end-

09:22.390 --> 09:25.230
You can't just forgive him on a whim,
you fake hero.

09:25.250 --> 09:29.470
The crime of betrayal hasn't disappeared
and I haven't forgiven him.

09:32.100 --> 09:33.100
But

09:33.940 --> 09:37.770
<i>if you hadn't stopped Nagi,
we couldn't have won.</i>

09:38.440 --> 09:39.520
So come on,

09:40.650 --> 09:42.150
get over here, you traitor!

09:50.330 --> 09:52.660
I'll hate you for the rest of my life!

09:52.670 --> 09:55.020
You've just paid the price for your betrayal now!

09:55.040 --> 09:56.459
Do you hear me, you bastard!

09:56.830 --> 09:58.730
You agree with me, right?

10:00.000 --> 10:01.790
You're the one deciding on a whim!

10:02.050 --> 10:04.420
Come on. Let's go back together.

10:05.130 --> 10:06.300
Okay.

10:08.400 --> 10:11.190
<i>All matches in Building 5 are complete.</i>

10:11.270 --> 10:14.280
<i>The results will now be announced.</i>

10:15.190 --> 10:19.240
<i>In the results of the tournament
featuring 5 teams,</i>

10:19.320 --> 10:22.660
<i>1st place Team V, 11 players advance.</i>

10:22.740 --> 10:25.910
<i>2nd place Team Z, 11 players advance.</i>

10:26.000 --> 10:28.500
<i>From the 3 eliminated teams,</i>

10:28.580 --> 10:30.380
<i>3 players advance with privilege.</i>

10:30.460 --> 10:32.130
<i>A total of 25 players,</i>

10:32.210 --> 10:35.880
<i>have passed the Building 5 first selection.</i>

10:35.960 --> 10:38.930
-Yeah!
-Yeah!

10:39.010 --> 10:41.680
<i>We survived!</i>

10:46.480 --> 10:47.310
Delicious!

10:47.390 --> 10:50.900
Hey! You're mooching again, Naruhaya.

10:50.980 --> 10:51.980
Catch!

10:52.520 --> 10:53.860
-Stop playing around and
-Coming!

10:53.940 --> 10:56.320
help prepare for the
celebration party!

10:56.400 --> 10:57.610
He's right.

10:57.690 --> 10:59.490
You've started eating too.

10:59.570 --> 11:01.990
Can someone go get some drinks?

11:02.070 --> 11:03.160
Alright!

11:03.240 --> 11:04.740
Let's go, Bachira.

11:05.490 --> 11:07.370
Is this much enough?

11:07.450 --> 11:08.540
I think it's enough.

11:09.330 --> 11:10.580
Ah, that's right.

11:11.170 --> 11:13.460
Thanks for the last pass, Bachira.

11:14.040 --> 11:15.800
It would've been impossible without you.

11:15.880 --> 11:19.260
What are you talking about?
I wasn't the amazing one.

11:20.760 --> 11:23.390
I can understand you, Isagi.

11:24.010 --> 11:25.410
You grasped something, didn't you?

11:27.270 --> 11:28.390
Yeah.

11:28.480 --> 11:31.400
I feel like I just now understood

11:32.020 --> 11:34.440
the truth about my own weapon.

11:35.150 --> 11:38.320
<i>Even though I can foresee the pitch
with my spatial awareness,</i>

11:38.400 --> 11:43.700
<i>I realized that I lose that advantage
when I control the ball.</i>

11:44.280 --> 11:48.040
<i>Then I looked back at my own goals and understood.</i>

11:48.870 --> 11:49.850
POSITIONING ACCORDING TO SPATIAL AWARENESS

11:49.883 --> 11:53.830
<i>I realized that I score my goals by hitting them directly.</i>

11:53.920 --> 11:58.340
I've turned the things I did unconsciously until now into a formula.

11:59.010 --> 12:03.090
From now on, I feel like it's time for the striker Isagi Yoichi to begin.

12:05.220 --> 12:08.770
Ah, sorry, I talked about myself too much.

12:08.850 --> 12:11.520
I liked your facial expression.
It's brimming with ego!

12:11.600 --> 12:12.520
Ego?

12:12.573 --> 12:14.873
Keep exciting me
from now on too,

12:14.900 --> 12:16.860
you egoist, Isagi Yoichi.

12:16.940 --> 12:18.820
Okay. You too.

12:18.900 --> 12:20.400
-Tap!
-That hurt!

12:21.650 --> 12:23.410
You...

12:28.790 --> 12:30.660
My dream,

12:31.250 --> 12:32.960
damn it.

12:33.040 --> 12:34.040
Damn it!

12:36.670 --> 12:38.550
<i>That's right.</i>

12:38.630 --> 12:41.550
<i>If they lose, they're kicked out of Blue Lock.</i>

12:42.590 --> 12:43.930
<i>Everything came to an end for them.</i>

12:45.220 --> 12:47.510
Congratulations on your victory.

12:49.510 --> 12:50.640
It's been a while.

12:51.350 --> 12:52.350
Niko.

12:53.390 --> 12:55.190
I survived too.

12:55.270 --> 12:57.190
As Team Y's top scorer.

12:57.270 --> 12:59.360
I see. Congratulations.

13:00.570 --> 13:01.570
<i>In that game,</i>

13:01.610 --> 13:04.740
<i>the goal that made us lose opened my eyes.</i>

13:05.740 --> 13:07.620
<i>I stopped holding back and passing,</i>

13:07.700 --> 13:11.160
<i>and decided to score goals myself.</i>

13:11.240 --> 13:15.330
Thanks to your goal, I'm still here.

13:16.210 --> 13:17.616
I won't lose next time.

13:18.710 --> 13:20.590
I'll be the one to crush you.

13:24.340 --> 13:27.640
The reason I'm here is also because of that moment,

13:27.720 --> 13:31.520
because you were in that match, Niko.

13:33.310 --> 13:34.980
Come at me anytime.

13:35.060 --> 13:36.480
I'll win again.

13:37.520 --> 13:38.520
You're pissing me off.

13:41.690 --> 13:43.820
Looks like you're quite popular, Isagi.

13:44.400 --> 13:45.570
How many rivals do you have?

13:47.860 --> 13:51.280
<i>My goal ends the dreams of others,</i>

13:51.370 --> 13:53.910
<i>and fuels the fighting spirit of some.</i>

13:54.500 --> 13:55.900
<i>I want to win more!</i>

13:56.290 --> 13:57.290
<i>More!</i>

13:59.250 --> 14:01.590
Sorry to keep you waiting. I got the drinks.

14:01.670 --> 14:03.050
Oh, I see.

14:09.090 --> 14:11.890
Pass the ball to me.

14:13.720 --> 14:17.770
<i>That night, we slept
with the comfort brought by victory.</i>

14:17.850 --> 14:19.860
TEAM Z QUALIFIES FOR THE 2ND SELECTION

14:26.440 --> 14:30.530
<i>From today, you will begin
physical conditioning training.</i>

14:30.620 --> 14:35.160
During this period, you will never touch a ball.

14:36.080 --> 14:38.370
Aren't we going straight to the 2nd selection!

14:38.460 --> 14:40.420
How long will the training last?

14:40.500 --> 14:42.340
He's right, tell us.

14:43.380 --> 14:45.130
Don't get cocky just because you survived

14:45.210 --> 14:47.760
in the worst building.

14:47.840 --> 14:51.090
Until I say it's enough, you pieces of trash.

14:51.180 --> 14:52.220
<i>What is this?</i>

14:52.300 --> 14:54.930
<i>Looks like it came out of a sci-fi movie.</i>

14:55.020 --> 14:57.850
Higher-ranked players were exempt from the first selection

14:57.930 --> 14:59.940
and started modern training.

15:00.020 --> 15:02.150
<i>Wait until they're done.</i>

15:02.230 --> 15:03.900
PHYSICAL CONDITIONING
DAY 1

15:03.980 --> 15:08.900
<i>Be grateful that we're improving
the conditioning of scrawny incompetents like you,</i>

15:08.990 --> 15:10.700
<i>trash.</i>

15:11.240 --> 15:13.700
<i>Realize that you're at the very bottom.</i>

15:13.780 --> 15:15.200
PHYSICAL CONDITIONING
DAY 3

15:20.460 --> 15:22.920
8 more sprints.

15:23.000 --> 15:25.250
Hey, are you okay, Isagi-kun?

15:25.340 --> 15:26.500
DAY 4

15:30.510 --> 15:31.680
DAY 5

15:35.680 --> 15:36.850
DAY 6

15:38.930 --> 15:39.850
DAY 7

15:39.940 --> 15:40.550
DAY 8

15:40.650 --> 15:41.500
DAY 9

15:46.610 --> 15:48.530
DAY 10

15:56.080 --> 16:00.120
<i>The first selection is complete.</i>

16:00.210 --> 16:02.080
<i>-Players who have advanced,
</i>-It's finally over.

16:02.170 --> 16:04.290
-Finally!
<i>-put on your uniforms and</i>

16:04.380 --> 16:07.630
<i>come to the ground floor area of the building.</i>

16:08.130 --> 16:09.130
<i>I repeat.</i>

16:09.210 --> 16:11.380
You're dragging it out, you bastard.

16:11.470 --> 16:15.010
If it had lasted one more day,
I would have wrecked this place.

16:15.100 --> 16:17.600
I agree. I'm going to take that lifestyle

16:17.680 --> 16:19.770
from those higher-ranked players living in luxury.

16:19.850 --> 16:21.230
That's right, amen!

16:21.310 --> 16:23.770
What's so great about being high-ranked anyway?

16:24.350 --> 16:26.440
<i>I can finally touch a ball.</i>

16:26.520 --> 16:28.730
<i>The second selection is starting.</i>

16:28.820 --> 16:29.860
We'll definitely win!

16:29.940 --> 16:31.320
Let's go, guys!

16:31.820 --> 16:35.700
<i>From here on, everyone is a higher-ranked player than us.</i>

16:35.780 --> 16:38.280
<i>But I'm not scared one bit.</i>

16:38.370 --> 16:41.370
<i>On the contrary, I want to test my power!</i>

16:42.080 --> 16:43.080
<i>Bring it on.</i>

16:43.160 --> 16:45.170
<i>I'll crush all of you!</i>

16:52.420 --> 16:54.430
<i>I guess those are the ones from the other buildings.</i>

16:55.300 --> 16:57.800
<i>They look a bit exhausted.</i>

16:59.600 --> 17:02.350
<i>Team W? Number 237?</i>

17:03.940 --> 17:05.480
<i>Team X is there too!</i>

17:05.560 --> 17:06.560
<i>What's going on?</i>

17:07.360 --> 17:10.110
<i>Greetings, rough diamonds.</i>

17:10.190 --> 17:12.820
<i>Good work on the physical conditioning training.</i>

17:12.900 --> 17:15.700
<i>You've probably already figured it out if you're not stupid.</i>

17:15.780 --> 17:20.160
<i>There's no one here from the first 4 buildings.</i>

17:20.240 --> 17:24.330
<i>Because there are no buildings
other than Building 5 in Blue Lock.</i>

17:24.410 --> 17:25.500
What?

17:26.120 --> 17:30.050
You all thought you were at the very bottom,

17:30.130 --> 17:34.170
and fought like idiots giving it your all in the first selection.

17:35.550 --> 17:37.180
Seriously? Screw you!

17:37.260 --> 17:38.430
Did you lie to us?

17:38.510 --> 17:40.180
Yes, I did.

17:40.260 --> 17:43.600
It was all a deception to shatter

17:43.680 --> 17:49.110
<i>your weak self-confidence and make you
bust your asses to become the best in the world.</i>

17:49.143 --> 17:50.495
-What the hell is that?
-Watch your mouth!

17:50.520 --> 17:52.070
We're not toys!

17:52.150 --> 17:53.360
Idiots.

17:53.440 --> 17:56.280
That aspect of you is what's weak.

17:56.910 --> 17:57.950
<i>Listen.</i>

17:58.030 --> 17:59.820
<i>Take Noel Noa, for example.</i>

17:59.910 --> 18:03.200
<i>Currently considered the world's best striker, Noa</i>

18:03.290 --> 18:05.040
<i>grew up in the slums of France.</i>

18:05.710 --> 18:07.580
<i>In a world of crime and poverty,</i>

18:07.670 --> 18:11.460
<i>the only way to change his fate was a soccer ball.</i>

18:11.960 --> 18:14.590
<i>He had no choice but soccer.</i>

18:15.470 --> 18:19.840
<i>There are quite a lot of forwards
in the world with stories like that.</i>

18:19.930 --> 18:23.430
<i>They have an endless hunger for goals.</i>

18:23.520 --> 18:28.028
<i>You, who will live a good life in Japan
even if you lose at soccer,</i>

18:28.230 --> 18:31.900
will acquire that hunger for goals

18:32.650 --> 18:35.490
that those players have, right here in Blue Lock.

18:35.570 --> 18:39.910
<i>You all came here hoping to defeat
those above you</i>

18:39.990 --> 18:43.370
<i>and to win, didn't you?</i>

18:43.450 --> 18:47.330
That hunger will transform into an ego that will change the world.

18:48.000 --> 18:51.000
<i>I want to test myself right away!</i>

18:53.670 --> 18:57.420
From this moment on, Blue Lock's
2nd selection begins.

18:57.510 --> 19:02.180
<i>The first selection was a struggle
where you came to understand</i>

19:02.260 --> 19:04.350
<i>forwards who made one from zero.</i>

19:04.430 --> 19:08.140
From here on, you will fight to increase
your value a hundredfold

19:08.230 --> 19:10.810
on a modern training ground.

19:11.730 --> 19:14.610
The 2nd selection consists of 5 stages,

19:14.690 --> 19:19.030
with a system where those who complete their current stage move up.

19:19.110 --> 19:22.030
And those who pass the 2nd selection

19:22.120 --> 19:24.620
<i>will be able to train with the world's best players,</i>

19:24.700 --> 19:27.160
<i>whom I have handpicked.</i>

19:27.250 --> 19:28.870
Holy shit.

19:30.920 --> 19:32.580
<i>That's all for the explanation.</i>

19:32.670 --> 19:35.920
<i>Those who feel ready should proceed
to the gate one by one.</i>

19:36.500 --> 19:39.050
-One by one?
-Aren't we together?

19:39.130 --> 19:41.220
Just as it should be,

19:41.300 --> 19:43.680
it will be many times harder than the first selection.

19:43.760 --> 19:46.760
Those who barely survived thanks to their teammates,

19:46.850 --> 19:47.970
<i>prepare yourselves.</i>

19:48.810 --> 19:51.640
In the 2nd selection, we'll first get rid of the trash.

19:51.730 --> 19:54.730
Only the true egoists will remain.

19:54.810 --> 19:55.900
Good luck.

19:58.860 --> 20:01.700
<i>From here on, I'll fight alone.</i>

20:02.780 --> 20:04.030
You go first.

20:04.120 --> 20:05.450
What? No way!

20:05.530 --> 20:07.660
<i>Everyone is holding back.</i>

20:10.710 --> 20:12.080
That guy is going.

20:16.290 --> 20:19.920
<i>He hit it cleanly. It's curving slightly high.</i>

20:23.590 --> 20:25.850
<i>This time a low, sharply curved shot?</i>

20:29.310 --> 20:30.600
Is this for real?

20:30.680 --> 20:33.100
<i>Who is that? Amazing!</i>

20:35.150 --> 20:36.150
Open the gate.

20:36.230 --> 20:37.820
My warm-up is done.

20:43.860 --> 20:45.700
Itoshi Rin?

20:46.280 --> 20:49.080
<i>The one in the top 11 of the new generation?</i>

20:49.160 --> 20:51.660
No, that one you mentioned is Itoshi Sae.

20:51.750 --> 20:53.580
Then who's this?

20:53.670 --> 20:57.210
Is this place full of scary guys like him?

20:58.090 --> 21:00.960
Remember our match against Team V.

21:01.050 --> 21:03.420
We're no less than them.

21:03.510 --> 21:04.930
You're right.

21:05.010 --> 21:07.600
My face block was beyond legendary!

21:08.220 --> 21:11.100
No, my shot was the legendary one.

21:11.180 --> 21:13.980
No, no, my dribbling was the legendary one.

21:14.060 --> 21:15.230
Don't be ridiculous.

21:15.310 --> 21:17.190
If it weren't for my legs, we would have lost.

21:18.060 --> 21:20.900
It was because I held the midfield, damn it!

21:20.946 --> 21:22.706
My defending was legendary too, you know!

21:22.780 --> 21:25.240
Me risking a red card to stop them too-

21:25.320 --> 21:27.570
Hey, that matter is different.

21:28.280 --> 21:31.450
My contributions were incredible too.

21:31.540 --> 21:33.870
Don't forget my legendary save either!

21:33.960 --> 21:35.540
My goal was legendary too.

21:35.620 --> 21:38.130
I'm the one who will become the best in the world.

21:38.210 --> 21:39.590
We're all legends!

21:39.670 --> 21:42.210
Let's meet beyond Blue Lock!

21:42.300 --> 21:44.380
-Okay!
-Okay!

21:45.880 --> 21:47.050
<i>Thank you, everyone.</i>

21:48.800 --> 21:51.600
<i>I was able to make it here because of all of you.</i>

21:55.310 --> 21:58.860
<i>From here on, I need to move forward alone.</i>

21:59.730 --> 22:03.570
<i>But strangely enough, I'm excited.</i>

22:04.400 --> 22:08.450
<i>This is different from the meaningless
excitement I felt before.</i>

22:08.950 --> 22:10.990
<i>I fought all the way here.</i>

22:11.080 --> 22:14.500
<i>The satisfaction I feel as a result.</i>

22:14.580 --> 22:17.670
<i>This thing is probably 'confidence'.</i>

22:19.960 --> 22:22.500
<i>Let's see what awaits me.</i>

22:23.500 --> 22:24.840
<i>In Blue Lock, I</i>

22:26.130 --> 22:27.550
<i>can become even stronger.</i>

23:14.560 --> 23:17.350
<i>Blue Lock, Extra Time.</i>

23:17.930 --> 23:20.350
Isagi went ahead but

23:20.406 --> 23:22.165
shall we decide the next one by drawing lots?

23:22.190 --> 23:24.730
I'll go next.

23:25.530 --> 23:26.440
No, me.

23:26.530 --> 23:27.400
Me, damn it!

23:27.490 --> 23:28.400
Me.

23:28.490 --> 23:29.450
Me, of course.

23:29.530 --> 23:31.030
-What about you, Chigiri?
-Me!

23:31.110 --> 23:33.490
The order won't change anything anyway.

23:33.570 --> 23:37.330
In situations like this,
they might be measuring our ego.

23:37.410 --> 23:38.450
Shoo shoo, look at that!

23:38.540 --> 23:42.080
'Like true egoists, play rock-paper-scissors.'

23:42.170 --> 23:44.750
It doesn't sound like Ego at all.

23:44.840 --> 23:46.880
Alright then, let's all do it together.

23:46.960 --> 23:49.220
-Rock, paper, scissors!
-Rock, paper, scissors!

23:49.760 --> 23:51.130
Ah, I won.

23:51.840 --> 23:53.390
Then I'm going first.

23:53.470 --> 23:54.680
Why, damn it?

23:54.760 --> 23:56.060
Shoo shoo!

23:56.140 --> 23:58.390
Come on, let's choose the next one.

23:58.470 --> 23:59.480
Second

23:59.560 --> 24:00.560
That's it.

24:00.640 --> 24:01.770
Come on!

24:01.850 --> 24:03.020
Ah, I won.

24:03.100 --> 24:04.060
Sixth

24:04.150 --> 24:05.770
Seventh
Eighth

24:05.860 --> 24:09.650
-Bye bye!
-Screw you!